    "map_name": "EverQuest short name / map identity (lowercase).",
    "display_name": "Human-readable subzone/map label.",
    "aliases": "Useful user-facing names that should resolve to this map.",
    "unverified": "The EQL Zones page lists New Sebilis Expedition but does not expose its /who short name in the supplied page text; preserve it as a source-label-only record rather than inventing a code."
